{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"options":{"content":"","images":{},"widgets":{}},"periodicTable":false,"type":"multiple"},"hints":[{"content":"We can play around with the expressions in the answer choices to see if they are the same as $4(-5z+2)+(-6)$.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the first expression is equivalent to $4(-5z+2)+(-6)$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{20z-2}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 4(-5z+2)+(-6)  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{20z-2}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}4(-5z)+4(2)+(-6)   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{20z-2}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}-20z+8+(-6)   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{20z-2}   \u0026\\ne -20z+2 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the second expression is equivalent to $4(-5z+2)+(-6)$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{2(-10z+1)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 4(-5z+2)+(-6)  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{2(-10z+1)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} (4)(-5z)+(4)2+(-6)   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{2(-10z+1)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -20z+8+(-6) \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{2(-10z+1)}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} -20z+2 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(2)(-10z)+(2)1}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}-20z+2 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-20z+2}   \u0026= -20z+2\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expression is equivalent to $4(-5z+2)+(-6)$ :\n\n\n-  ${2(-10z+1)} $\n","images":{},"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $4(-5z+2)+(-6)$ ?**  \n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$20z-2$","correct":false},{"content":"$2(-10z+1)$","correct":true},{"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":false},"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
